        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Saddex iyo weliba afar xadgudub oo ay reer Turos sameeyeen aawadood ayaanan ciqaabtooda uga noqonaynin, maxaa yeelay, iyagu dadkii oo dhan ayay u gacangeliyeen reer Edom, oo soo mana ay xusuusan axdigii walaalnimada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
