              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Saddex iyo weliba afar xadgudub oo ay reer Edom sameeyeen aawadood ayaanan ciqaabtooda uga noqonaynin, maxaa yeelay, iyagu walaalahood bay seef ku eryadeen, oo way iska xooreen naxariis oo dhan, oo xanaaqoodiina had iyo goorba bay la qarxeen, oo cadho bay la gubanayeen weligoodba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.1.11",
